    in a session, read the complete protocol and packet template:
    @spec://org.vibevm.world/zai-glm-claude/flows/zai-glm-claude/ZAI-GLM-CLAUDE-PROTOCOL#root
    and
    @spec://org.vibevm.world/zai-glm-claude/flows/zai-glm-claude/packet-template#root.
